@startuml
title CR1 additions to Figures 5.3, 5.4 and 5.10
class Assignment {
  +id: int
  +deadline: UTC
}
class ClassExtension {
  +assignmentId: int
  +newDeadline: UTC
  +reason: string
  +grantedBy: int
  +grantedAt: UTC
}
class Extension {
  +studentId: int
  +newDeadline: UTC
}
class ExtensionService {
  +grantClassExtension(user, assignment, deadline, reason): void
  +grantExtension(user, assignment, student, deadline, reason): void
}
Assignment "1" *-- "0..1" ClassExtension
Assignment "1" *-- "0..*" Extension
ExtensionService --> Assignment
ExtensionService --> ClassExtension
ExtensionService --> Extension
note right of ExtensionService
Effective = max(base, class, individual)
All writes in one transaction.
Assigned lecturers only.
Reject if any submission already marked.
end note
@enduml
